{
  "name": "@maitask/text-parser",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "High-performance text and markdown parser",
  "main": "index.js",
  "types": "index.d.ts",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "author": "Maitask Team <team@maitask.com>",
  "license": "MIT",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/maitask/packages/tree/main/text-parser",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/maitask/packages.git",
    "directory": "text-parser"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/maitask/packages/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "maitask",
    "parser",
    "text",
    "markdown",
    "plaintext",
    "document",
    "processing",
    "utf8",
    "base64"
  ],
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "index.d.ts",
    "README.md",
    "example.json"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18.0.0"
  },
  "display_name": "Text Parser",
  "category": "Data Processing & Transformation",
  "maitask": {
    "locales": {
      "en": {
        "display_name": "Text Parser",
        "description": "High-performance text and markdown parser",
        "category": "Data Processing & Transformation",
        "keywords": [
          "maitask",
          "parser",
          "text",
          "markdown",
          "plaintext",
          "document",
          "processing",
          "utf8",
          "base64"
        ]
      },
      "zh": {
        "display_name": "文本解析器",
        "description": "高性能文本与 Markdown 解析器，支持纯文本、文档内容和编码处理。",
        "category": "数据处理与转换",
        "keywords": [
          "文本解析",
          "Markdown",
          "纯文本",
          "文档",
          "UTF-8",
          "Base64"
        ]
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "input": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Text",
            "default": "# Artificial Intelligence Trends 2025\n\n## Overview\nThe field of artificial intelligence continues to evolve rapidly in 2025.\n\n### Key Technologies\n- Machine Learning\n- Natural Language Processing\n- Computer Vision\n\n```javascript\nconst ai = new AIModel();\nawait ai.train(dataset);\n```\n\n## Conclusion\nThe future looks promising."
          },
          "extension": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Extension",
            "default": "md"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
